        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "30",
          "id": "66-30",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 62,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "\"small enterprise\" shall be an enterprise classified as such under the notification in this behalf by the Central Government under the Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises Development Act, 2006 (27 of 2006);",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "31",
          "id": "66-31",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 63,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "\"speculative transaction\" means a transaction in which a contract for the purchase or sale of any commodity, including stocks and shares, is periodically or ultimately settled otherwise than by the actual delivery or transfer of the commodity or scrips, other than the following transactions:—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "66-31-a",
              "indent": 0,
              "line_start": 64,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "a specified derivative transaction as defined in clause (33);",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-66-31-a-001",
                  "target_id": "66-31-33",
                  "target_type": "clause",
                  "anchor_text": "clause (33)",
                  "relationship": "definition_reference",
                  "confidence": "medium"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "66-31-b",
              "indent": 0,
              "line_start": 65,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "a contract in respect of raw materials or merchandise entered into by a person in the course of his manufacturing or merchandising business to guard against loss through future price fluctuations in respect of his contracts for actual delivery of goods manufactured, or merchandise sold by him;",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "c",
              "id": "66-31-c",
              "indent": 0,
              "line_start": 66,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "a contract in respect of stocks and shares entered into by a dealer or investor therein to guard against loss in his holdings of stocks and shares through price fluctuations;",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "d",
              "id": "66-31-d",
              "indent": 0,
              "line_start": 67,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "a contract entered into by a member of a forward market or a stock exchange in the course of any transaction in the nature of jobbing or arbitrage, to guard against loss which may arise in the ordinary course of his business as such member;",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "32",
          "id": "66-32",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 68,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "\"Specified Banking or Online Mode\" shall mean transaction by an account payee cheque or an account payee bank draft or use of electronic clearing system through a bank account or through such other electronic mode, as may be prescribed;",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "33",
          "id": "66-33",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 69,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "\"specified derivative transaction\" means any transaction in respect of trading in derivatives referred to in section 2(ac) of the Securities Contracts (Regulation) Act, 1956 (42 of 1956); or in respect of trading in commodity derivatives (other than agricultural commodity derivatives) which is chargeable to commodities transaction tax under Chapter VII of the Finance Act, 2013 (17 of 2013) or in respect of trading in agricultural commodity derivatives, if such transactions are—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "66-33-a",
              "indent": 0,
              "line_start": 70,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text_before_sub_clauses": "is carried out—",
              "sub_clauses": [
                {
                  "type": "sub_clause",
                  "number": "i",
                  "id": "66-33-a-i",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "line_start": 71,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "through a stock broker or such other intermediary registered under section 12 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India Act, 1992 (15 of 1992) in accordance with the provisions of the Securities Contracts (Regulation) Act, 1956 (42 of 1956) or the Securities and Exchange Board of India Act, 1992 (15 of 1992) or the Depositories Act, 1996 (22 of 1996) and the rules, regulations or bye-laws made or directions issued under those Acts; or",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub_clause",
                  "number": "ii",
                  "id": "66-33-a-ii",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "line_start": 72,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "by banks or mutual funds, electronically on screen-based systems of a recognised stock exchange; and (b) supported by a time stamped contract note issued by the intermediary to every client indicating in the contract note—",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub_clause",
                  "number": "i",
                  "id": "66-33-a-i",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "line_start": 74,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "the unique client identity number allotted under any law in force; and",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "sub_clause",
                  "number": "ii",
                  "id": "66-33-a-ii",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "line_start": 75,
                  "page_start": 1,
                  "page_end": 1,
                  "text": "the Permanent Account Number allotted under this Act;",
                  "children": []
                }
              ],
              "text_after_sub_clauses": ""
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-66-33-001",
              "target_id": "2-ac",
              "target_type": "clause",
              "anchor_text": "section 2(ac)",
              "relationship": "definition_reference",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
